  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till &#xF6;verf&#xF6;rande av ansvar f&#xF6;r &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndandefr&#xE5;gor fr&#xE5;n det internationella samfundet i Bosnien (OHR, UNHCR) till lokal niv&#xE5; (regionala centra under Ministry of Human Rights and Refugees). St&#xF6;det kommer att utg&#xE5; under det f&#xF6;rsta &#xE5;ret f&#xF6;r att underl&#xE4;tta en smidig &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ng samt till att genomf&#xF6;ra utbildningsaktiviteter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the transfer of responsibilities for returnee issues from the International Community in Bosnia (OHR, UNHCR) to local level (Regional Centers under the Ministry of Human Rights and Refugees). The support will be given during the first year in order to  facilitate a smooth transition and to undertake training activities.</narrative>
  </description>
